+WA(X,Y) = X_A Y-X Y_A,
+WZ(X,Y) = X_Z Y-X Y_Z,
+
+Even = 2A^2(P_A S0-Q (R0)_A)
+       +4H(J(P,S0)+J(Q,R0))
+       +chi(Q (R0)_Z-P_Z S0),
