+```text
+E2 = b Z eta^2
+```
+
+and the equation at even `A`-degree two is always `EQ2_even`. Define
+
+```text
+E2 = b Z eta^2,                         D2 = a Z eta^3,
+C2 = Z eta(3a s+c5 eta)/(2b),           E1 = E2' + G,
+D1 = D2' + (3a/(2b)) eta G,
