+P  = p + A C1 + A^2 C2,                 Q  = q + A D1 + A^2 D2,
+R0 = r + A E1 + A^2 E2,                 S0 = s,
+H  = A + A^2 Z,                          chi = 2 + 4AZ.
+```
+
+For polynomials in `(A,Z)`, set
+
+```text
+J(X,Y)  = X_A Y_Z-X_Z Y_A,
+WA(X,Y) = X_A Y-X Y_A,
+WZ(X,Y) = X_Z Y-X Y_Z,
+
+Even = 2A^2(P_A S0-Q (R0)_A)
+       +4H(J(P,S0)+J(Q,R0))
+       +chi(Q (R0)_Z-P_Z S0),
+
+Odd  = 2A^2 WA(Q,S0)+4J(P,R0)+4H J(Q,S0)-chi WZ(Q,S0).
+```
