+DEV-PROJECTION e=1,2,3  MAIN CHAMBER-II IDEALS ARE UNIT:
+                        I_e=(1), hence J_e=I_e intersect Q[c]=(1).
+                        There are no c candidates and no finite-U boxes to list.
