+with all variables except `c` in the first elimination block and `c` last.
+The adapter-safe map removes underscores only:
+
+```text
+eta_j -> etaj, G_j -> Gj, X_j -> Xj, Y_j -> Yj;
+kappa -> kappa, tt -> tt, c -> c.
