+The following three polynomial clearings exact-diff to the canonical source
+rows:
+
+```text
+F1 = 4b^2 eta^2 EQ1_even,
+F2 = 2b^2 eta^2 EQ2_even,
+F3 = b EQ3_even.
+```
+
+They contain no `s` or any derivative of `s`. Explicitly, with
