+```text
+qqideal 0.2.0
+msolveio 0.2.1
+msolve 0.10.1
+msolve executable SHA-256:
+cc992ccc89cefdcff9ea697ecd05fc4fe99cca8592b423d30d9cca0e04a00ea2
+SymPy 1.14.0
