+```text
+c^2*kappa*tt + 2c*kappa*tt - 1
+```
+
+returns `[1]`. This is exactly the variable/ring-map and explicit-
+Rabinowitsch guardrail in FALLACY-v2; the spurious nonconstant eliminant is not
+consumed.
