+| Chamber I, `g>2e` | `OPEN[A2-CHAMBER-I]` | Generate fixed `(e,g)` jobs with `deg X,deg Y<=2g-1` and an explicit row `kappa*G_g*tt-1`; no global `g` cap is known. |
