+## 4. Corrected deviation system
+
+Set
+
+```text
+X = 4b eta^2 r-s^2,       Y = 4b^2 eta q-3a s^2,
+N(W) = eta W'-2W eta'.
+```
+
+After T1 and `E0`, substitute
