+The exact source map is
+
+```text
+[A^0,A^1,A^2] Odd  -> [O0,O1,O2],
+[A^0] Even-kappa   -> E0,
+[A^1,A^2,A^3] Even -> [EQ1_even,EQ2_even,EQ3_even].
+```
+
+More strongly, as whole polynomial identities,
