+```text
+a=b=1, eta=s=Z, G=-2Z^2, c5=kappa=0,
+p=0, C1=(3/2)Z^2, q=(3/4)Z, r=1/4,
+C2=(3/2)Z^3, D1=Z^3, D2=Z^4, E1=Z^2, E2=Z^3.
