+```text
+1 in I_e,       J_e=I_e intersect Q[c]=(1),       e=1,2,3.
+```
+
+The declared capped branch-(A) subsystem is empty. This is the first outcome
+on Card 1, so
+there are no roots of a nonconstant eliminant to list and no branch-(A)
