+## 1. Canonical corrected section 1
+
+Work in `C[Z]` in characteristic zero. A prime below means `d/dZ`, never a
+label and never `d/dV`. Put `deg(0)=-infinity`. Let
+
+```text
+a,b,c5,kappa in C,       a*b*kappa != 0,
+eta,s,p,C1,q,r,G in C[Z], eta != 0.
